            pop-launcher, wayland, and cosmic-icons</para>

    </sect2>

      <sect2 role="installation">
        <title>Installation of Cosmic-launcher</title>

    <para>Prepare Cosmic-launcher for compilation:</para>

    <para>Fetch the dependencies, ensuring the exact versions recorded in the
      existing <filename>Cargo.lock</filename> file are used:</para>

        <screen><userinput remap="configure">cargo fetch --locked</userinput></screen>

      <para>To Compile the Package, issue:</para>

        <screen><userinput remap="make">export LOCKSTEP_XML_PATH=${PWD}/vendor/atspi-common/xml &amp;&amp;

cargo build --release</userinput></screen>

      <para>Now Install the Package, issue:</para>

        <screen><userinput remap="install">install -vDm755 target/release/cosmic-launcher /usr/bin/cosmic-launcher &amp;&amp;

install -vDm644 data/com.system76.CosmicLauncher.desktop \
  /usr/share/applications/com.system76.CosmicLauncher.desktop &amp;&amp;

install -vDm644 data/com.system76.CosmicLauncher.metainfo.xml \
  /usr/share/metainfo/com.system76.CosmicLauncher.metainfo.xml &amp;&amp;

install -vDm644 data/icons/com.system76.CosmicLauncher.svg \
  /usr/share/icons/hicolor/scalable/apps/com.system76.CosmicLauncher.svg</userinput></screen>

      </sect2>

